{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "036F", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0002": "$X \\to Y$", "MATH_0003": "$X' \\to Y'$", "MATH_0004": "$X \\to Y$", "MATH_0005": "$\\tau$", "MATH_0006": "$\\tau$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5f45c720fd6cfd86d598936488760e40cf997cf96795b91da8ee5633b5ecb810", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:06b76fbd15e8f54284dfcf9b72a0d5cf6057ac559b321a0bb97ba35f65de31b1", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nTo be sure, since isomorphisms are always coverings\nwe see (or require) that property <MATH_0001> holds for <MATH_0002>\nif and only if it holds for any arrow <MATH_0003> isomorphic to <MATH_0004>.\nIf a property is <MATH_0005>-local on the source then it is preserved by\nprecomposing with morphisms which occur in <MATH_0006>-coverings. Here\nis a formal statement.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:49ff8c7f1a274189ba8ef52a6e0e51990d62a70084ce6b43c148b616d449fb65", "unit_id": "tag:036F:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "036F", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$\\tau \\in \\{fpqc, fppf, syntomic, smooth, \\etale, Zariski\\}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\tau$", "MATH_0004": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0006": "$a : X' \\to X$", "MATH_0007": "$f \\circ a : X' \\to Y$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ ", "SPACE_0003": "\\ ", "SPACE_0004": "\\ "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-precompose-property-local-source}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8d5bb8641cc61a9e7f0d150de4de527e97bd7dec24dd9568f67d70a280b25f2f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6059d43ed873ea7b5de8af48d22313a7c3480abd1e09953548c594bf3c0377b1", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a property of morphisms which is <MATH_0003> local\non the source. Let <MATH_0004> have property <MATH_0005>.\nFor any morphism <MATH_0006> which is\nflat, resp.<SPACE_0001>flat and locally of finite presentation, resp.<SPACE_0002>syntomic,\nresp.<SPACE_0003><ACCENT_0001>tale, resp.<SPACE_0004>an open immersion, the composition\n<MATH_0007> has property <MATH_0008>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ad2898efd64d2df98a6591324d5b1528296c26f9755be23f7003bd63e40234e4", "unit_id": "tag:04QV:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "036F", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X' \\to X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\tau$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d571409c118fa74d645058b42e99879f9b421614d0977eb849f62345902d4d03", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c9710a95eb7d1d2f9580f36262830e0d6cae6a9644db408478909c257a3ab0a1", "source_text": "This is true because we can fit <MATH_0001> into a family of\nmorphisms which forms a <MATH_0002>-covering.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f136925c8bd7c0c110b6c290e7c3b5b880cf5cecf24fe559a694f7702cf47e6d", "unit_id": "tag:04QV:proof"}
